    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812820/extras/5f4faae9784b11fd8894ce1470c4ac36.poster.avif?t=1752604041\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812820/extras/5f4faae9784b11fd8894ce1470c4ac36.webm?t=1752604041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812820/extras/5f4faae9784b11fd8894ce1470c4ac36.mp4?t=1752604041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Par</strong> is a relaxing and colorful 2D mini golf experience with a retro pixel art style and creative twists. Whether you're aiming for a hole-in-one or exploring secret shortcuts, Pixel Par invites you to unwind, customize, and play your way through a variety of imaginative courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple modes and abilities, you\u2019re free to experiment and discover clever solutions for low-stroke victories. Tackle a campaign full of surprises, race against the clock in time trials, or push your limits in hardcore mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for casual players and completionists, Pixel Par offers cozy vibes, vibrant visuals, and an original soundtrack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong><br>Freeplay, 18 Holes, Speedrun, and Hardcore challenges offer something for every play style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign with Upgraded Abilities:</strong> <br>Use <i>Wind</i>, <i>Freeze</i>, and <i>Teleport</i> powers to master tricky shots and overcome challenging obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Cosmetic Customization:</strong><br>Unlock stylish hats and personalize them with color variations. Customize your golf ball's color too!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Achievements &amp; Secrets:</strong><br>Hunt for hidden hats and complete a wide range of achievements to show off your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Pixel Art:</strong><br>Relax with cozy retro-inspired visuals and a soothing, colorful world.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812820/extras/5f4faae9784b11fd8894ce1470c4ac36.poster.avif?t=1752604041\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812820/extras/5f4faae9784b11fd8894ce1470c4ac36.webm?t=1752604041\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3812820/extras/5f4faae9784b11fd8894ce1470c4ac36.mp4?t=1752604041\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pixel Par</strong> is a relaxing and colorful 2D mini golf experience with a retro pixel art style and creative twists. Whether you're aiming for a hole-in-one or exploring secret shortcuts, Pixel Par invites you to unwind, customize, and play your way through a variety of imaginative courses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With multiple modes and abilities, you\u2019re free to experiment and discover clever solutions for low-stroke victories. Tackle a campaign full of surprises, race against the clock in time trials, or push your limits in hardcore mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for casual players and completionists, Pixel Par offers cozy vibes, vibrant visuals, and an original soundtrack.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Game Modes:</strong><br>Freeplay, 18 Holes, Speedrun, and Hardcore challenges offer something for every play style.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Campaign with Upgraded Abilities:</strong> <br>Use <i>Wind</i>, <i>Freeze</i>, and <i>Teleport</i> powers to master tricky shots and overcome challenging obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Cosmetic Customization:</strong><br>Unlock stylish hats and personalize them with color variations. Customize your golf ball's color too!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<strong>Achievements &amp; Secrets:</strong><br>Hunt for hidden hats and complete a wide range of achievements to show off your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charming Pixel Art:</strong><br>Relax with cozy retro-inspired visuals and a soothing, colorful world.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Putt your way through unique courses across a variety of modes, using upgraded abilities to assist you and overcome tricky challenges your way.",
